*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%
*% RICOH SP 6410 — RPDL via Ghostscript
*% PS3 カード非搭載機を macOS の印刷ダイアログから使うための PPD。
*% 実際の変換は cupsFilter に指定した pdftorpdl が行う。
*%
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "RPDL6410.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "RICOH"
*Product: "(SP 6410)"
*ModelName: "RICOH SP 6410 RPDL"
*ShortNickName: "RICOH SP 6410 RPDL"
*NickName: "RICOH SP 6410 (RPDL via Ghostscript)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "32"
*TTRasterizer: Type42

*cupsVersion: 2.0
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsFilter: "application/pdf 0 /Library/Printers/RICOH-RPDL/filter/pdftorpdl"
*cupsFilter: "application/postscript 0 /Library/Printers/RICOH-RPDL/filter/pdftorpdl"

*OpenGroup: General/General

*OpenUI *PageSize/Page Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A3/A3: "<</PageSize[842 1191]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize B4/B4 (JIS): "<</PageSize[729 1032]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize B5/B5 (JIS): "<</PageSize[516 729]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Page Region: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A3/A3: "<</PageSize[842 1191]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion B4/B4 (JIS): "<</PageSize[729 1032]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion B5/B5 (JIS): "<</PageSize[516 729]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "12 12 583 830"
*ImageableArea A3/A3: "12 12 830 1179"
*ImageableArea A5/A5: "12 12 408 583"
*ImageableArea B4/B4 (JIS): "12 12 717 1020"
*ImageableArea B5/B5 (JIS): "12 12 504 717"
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "12 12 600 780"
*ImageableArea Legal/US Legal: "12 12 600 996"

*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension A3/A3: "842 1191"
*PaperDimension A5/A5: "420 595"
*PaperDimension B4/B4 (JIS): "729 1032"
*PaperDimension B5/B5 (JIS): "516 729"
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension Legal/US Legal: "612 1008"

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 600dpi/600 dpi: "<</HWResolution[600 600]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 400dpi/400 dpi: "<</HWResolution[400 400]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 240dpi/240 dpi: "<</HWResolution[240 240]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *Duplex/2-Sided Printing: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *Duplex
*DefaultDuplex: None
*Duplex None/Off: "<</Duplex false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexNoTumble/Long-Edge (Standard): "<</Duplex true/Tumble false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexTumble/Short-Edge (Flip): "<</Duplex true/Tumble true>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Duplex

*CloseGroup: General

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(001.004S)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica: Standard "(001.006S)" Standard ROM
*Font Times-Roman: Standard "(001.007S)" Standard ROM

*% End of PPD
